    image: 'Close-Grip_EZ-Bar_Curl_with_Band.jpg',
    description: "Attach a band to each end of the bar. Take the bar, placing a foot on the middle of the band. Stand upright with a narrow, supinated grip on the EZ bar. The elbows should be close to the torso. This will be your starting position.",
